    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19741" root="سطع" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسْطَعُ</span></b>  <i>Long-necked;</i> (K;) applied to a camel,
and an ostrich: (TA:) fem. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَطْعَآءُ</span>; applied to a
she-camel, (TA,) and a she-ostrich. (S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُنُقٌ أَسْطَعُ</span> <i>A long, erect, neck:</i> (TA:) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُنُقٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِطْعَآءُ</span> <i>a neck that is long, and erect in its sinews.</i>
(AO, in describing horses; and TA.)

